Well, I checked the source code (v 3.0i) to see what happens here.  Zapping
yourself with a wand of striking doesn't make you visible, but there
are some pretty funny messages if you zap yourself with various wands:

Wand of Striking: "Boing!" (if magic resistant)
            or: "You magically bash yourself!" (if not).

Wand of Ligntning: "Idiot! You've shocked yourslf!" (non-shock resistant)
            or:    "You zap yourself, but seem unharmed."

Wand of Fire:      "You've set light to yourself!" (non-fire resistant)
	    or:    "You feel mildly hot."

Wand of Cold:      "You imitate a popsocle!"    (non-cold resistant)
	    or:    "You feel mildly chilly."

Wand of Magic Missile:  "Idiot!  You've shot yourself!"
	    or:    "The missile bounces."

Wand of Death:     "You irradiate yourslef with pure energy!  You die!"
	    or:    "The wand shoots an apparently harmless beam at you."
	    or:    "You seem no deaded than before." (if polymorphed to
						      an undead creature.)


